{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "d5db58ffcc7edeb804c418c53e10a9ca3e063d6e90b5497fde4f51a1df4383f4", "ja": "ドラマのお仕事", "zh": "戏剧工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4000_place", "source_sha256": "d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c", "ja": "事務所", "zh": "办公室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4001_035hin", "source_sha256": "30941e7a800c2551d4399f6d3affff40e659e420bee76de98a5978f8af356ccc", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nあたし、どうしたらいいんだろか……？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4002_p", "source_sha256": "2d009a7bf652d83385e06be8a17338f167b477192e6237fe6672e69ea2fa817a", "ja": "どうしたんだ、ひなた？\nそんなに困った顔して……。", "zh": "怎么了，日向？\n怎么一脸烦恼的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4003_p", "source_sha256": "31ce6d776fa27b8f4f6d14c70a1dd692951ba144e41594d9232ed0370e6033a7", "ja": "ドラマの役をもらったって、\nあんなに喜んでたじゃないか？", "zh": "你之前不是还因为拿到戏剧角色，\n开心得不得了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4004_035hin", "source_sha256": "1de11872660f12ade3bb6c571427e030268e4ac6c76f165f9e975033a664808e", "ja": "それがね、あたしの役、\nきれいな標準語を話すんだわぁ……。", "zh": "就是呀，我饰演的角色，\n说着一口流利的标准语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4005_035hin", "source_sha256": "ed0f6d437526daaad21414bac7b461f4dc8736b73482584d5ca42de1906ad13f", "ja": "あたし、この子のセリフ、うまく言える自信ないよぉ。\nつい、いつもの調子でしゃべっちゃう気がするんだぁ。", "zh": "我没有自信能够流畅地说出她的台词呀……\n总觉得会不小心用平常的语气说出话来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4006_p", "source_sha256": "6d2249ebff03ad0c62b1ee42ed3c4647018dd8c1bf5bf881fc65be9f9ee6138e", "ja": "う～ん、そうか。方言が出るのを気にしてるんだな。\nじゃあ……。", "zh": "我想想～这样啊，你担心自己说出方言啊，\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4007", "source_sha256": "bcd5b19ca5a094da0c9cc6a142339115f1937e5b7784eb3b28ad84af00605d51", "ja": "練習あるのみ！", "zh": "只能多练习了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4008", "source_sha256": "85da5b6b3147464c1dcf3c8302ccd8d49f9d0d7ae8f999a0cf6acf074651f864", "ja": "俺に続け！", "zh": "跟着我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4009", "source_sha256": "2a75a2033833a6da966f61251d104cc0d2e7a3efa33d1b6358a94f5ac2238826", "ja": "いっそ方言で……", "zh": "干脆就用方言……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4100_p", "source_sha256": "1c6c426881db2e8cb20ee0eac7f45b6709bc6f4d2e77c26f10d1ed3860ba5b93", "ja": "とにかく練習するしかないな。慣れれば、\nきっと標準語のセリフだって、すらすら言えるさ。", "zh": "总之只能多练习了吧，只要习惯了，\n一定也能流利地说出标准语台词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4101_035hin", "source_sha256": "a5e70d4f73e0fc535c6c3f03c4c4c1467987959cec2ca88df88a30896fdef796", "ja": "そっかぁ……。そうだねぇ。あたし、\nやる前から、できっこないって思いこんでたよぉ。", "zh": "这样呀……没错呢～我在行动之前，\n就满脑子认为做不到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4102_035hin", "source_sha256": "3038469f29a0e7b5c786a6f8e04bf904abcad0e369ac985b2d38f889ecbe86de", "ja": "まず、練習してみるべさ！\nありがとね、{$P$}。", "zh": "我应该先练习看看哪！\n谢谢你了呢，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4200_p", "source_sha256": "1b8fb5ef7a9df0efe18fd599069fb567472fa2652ba64194180e656bfc64bfce", "ja": "よし！　まず、俺が台本を読み上げるから、\nひなたは、俺の後に続いて復唱してみようか。", "zh": "好！那由我先念一次剧本，\n日向就接在我后面复诵看看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4201_035hin", "source_sha256": "f4e793af337ccf0514da4123ea87d541110557390ce9af528e0172a7c7ba6d58", "ja": "ええっ？　……ふふっ、{$P$}、\nまるで学校の先生みたいだよぉ！", "zh": "咦咦？……呵呵，{$P$}，\n你好像学校老师喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4202_035hin", "source_sha256": "7b05c25826cf646dd358ac0d5782956912104b2d126f482f5b87a40060d84d95", "ja": "なんか、笑ったら気が軽くなったべさ。\nあたし、がんばるから……練習、つきあってねぇ？", "zh": "总觉得笑一笑，心情就轻松起来了哪，\n我会加油的……你要陪我练习喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4300_p", "source_sha256": "f3ab7f27918b9c1623e7a6f55d1d94c0f83908ad98f7be93a03b37f56f52448e", "ja": "いっそ、方言まじりのセリフに変更してもらおうか。", "zh": "干脆请剧组把方言加到台词里面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4301_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4302_p", "source_sha256": "01a6614fb1b584bd6473866ce469ac41230af1ed761bee2e96aaaaa4e1885be2", "ja": "その方が、ひなたのよさが伝わる、\nいいドラマになるかもしれないしな！", "zh": "说不定这样更能成为展现日向优点\n的一部好戏啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4303_035hin", "source_sha256": "847a183267aeddcd2957a4919e83b7a0082310cc7c71ba9863e2cb6c5bcbaa06", "ja": "うう、そう言ってもらえるのはうれしいけど……。\nそれじゃ、みんなに申し訳ないよぉ。", "zh": "呜呜，虽然很高兴你这么说……\n但这样太对不起大家了啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_4304_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe7a3f80518e90dead92ad8ea007fe56e8eff7c81a2d9a28351e89de788cee48", "ja": "あたし、練習がんばってみるから……もう少し\n待ってくれんかなぁ？　{$P$}。", "zh": "我会努力练习的……\n{$P$}，可以再等我一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
